/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:113:- **D-MIN-5 (now measured, previously zero-by-construction). C2 tie frequency.** The build-3 code had no C2 tie-break and the field was hard-coded `False`. This pilot implemented the smallest schema-satisfying measurement: the fraction of non-incumbent (user, action) candidates whose FULL-arm C2 head score exactly equals the incumbent's. Measured value: **0.0** on both catalogue anchors (`c2_tie_frequency` 0.0, `c2_tie_pair_fraction_mean` 0.0). The C2 head discriminates every candidate; the zero is now an observation rather than an artefact, but it is still a proxy for head indiscriminability, not for a build-3 tie-break code path.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:115:- **D-MIN-7 (scope). Statistical power is nil.** 5 anchors x 1 carrier x 2 learner seeds = 10 FULL decisions per catalogue anchor. No interval, no seed-variance estimate and no contrast in this report is powered. The g_A/g_I quantiles below are computed over 10 points and p05/p95 coincide with min/max.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:117:- **D-MIN-9 (schema shortcut). `top_choice_agreement` differs sharply by catalogue anchor** (0.5 on `P-a0`, 0.0 on `P-u`) with no obvious mechanism at this sample size; recorded so it is checked, not explained.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:133:- Exact S0 over 48 boundaries for every catalogue profile was unbounded in the joined engine. The pilot ranks S0's top-two proposals with provider-primitive C1+C2, applies the same bounded evacuation rule, evaluates that set with exact nominal boundary-0 physics, then evaluates the committed S0 profile over all 48 realised boundaries.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:134:- Exhaustive exact interaction decomposition over every catalogue row was also unbounded. Exact Psi is computed for every P-u joint escape candidate and every selected FULL coalition; other rows retain learned scoring only. P-u top-10 users are primitive-ranked by |d_i^u|. The pilot S_UNI wall budget was reduced to 5 seconds, with the engine's fallback and termination certificate retained verbatim.
